  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Brand introduction:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">At Soothing Blue, we believe that radiant skin begins from within. Our holistic skincare brand is rooted in the principles of care, calm, and connection. We empower women to embrace their natural beauty through self-care rituals that nourish the skin, mind, and soul. Our moisturizer is thoughtfully crafted with a blend of nature and science to deliver visible results and lasting tranquility.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Product description:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our signature moisturizer is a luxurious, multi-functional cream designed for busy women who crave simplicity without compromise. Infused with a powerful blend of natural oils, vitamins, and botanicals like aloe vera, jojoba, rosehip, and vitamin C, it hydrates, soothes, and revives tired skin in one step. Perfect as a morning base under makeup or a calming evening ritual.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"1156\" data-start=\"1100\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1156\" data-start=\"1102\">Holistic skincare that nurtures mind, body, and soul</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1238\" data-start=\"1157\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1238\" data-start=\"1159\">Multi-tasking moisturizer: hydrates, fights signs of aging, and adds radiance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1366\" data-start=\"1302\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1366\" data-start=\"1304\">Luxurious texture that absorbs easily without clogging pores</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1445\" data-start=\"1367\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1445\" data-start=\"1369\">Built-in wellness community and ongoing self-care content to support users</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1477\" data-start=\"1452\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong data-end=\"1477\" data-start=\"1459\">Payment Terms:</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1478\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1538\" data-start=\"1478\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1538\" data-start=\"1480\">Affiliates earn <strong data-end=\"1514\" data-start=\"1496\">10% commission</strong> on all referral sales</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1538\" data-start=\"1478\">Affiliates earn <strong>20% commission</strong> on all sales made directly through their link</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1611\" data-start=\"1539\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1611\" data-start=\"1541\">Commission is tracked via affiliate link and/or personal coupon code</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1677\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1679\">30-day cookie window</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1677\">Payments will be made via bank transfer or through credit card</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Other information</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"1770\" data-start=\"1738\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1770\" data-start=\"1740\">Average order value: $40&ndash;$65( depending on discount given)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1843\" data-start=\"1771\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1843\" data-start=\"1773\">High conversion rate among busy, wellness-conscious women aged 25&ndash;40</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1894\" data-start=\"1844\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1894\" data-start=\"1846\">Free shipping in the USA</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1979\" data-start=\"1895\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1979\" data-start=\"1897\">Affiliates get our moisturizer Auraa for free and will get early access to new product&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2034\" data-start=\"1980\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2034\" data-start=\"1982\">Affiliate dashboard with real-time tracking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2034\" data-start=\"1980\">Our brand prioritizes given back and plans to donate 20% of revenue to causes chosen by community.</li>\r\n</ul>",
